WEBVTT

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:08.950
Fumizuki Academy is a new school that has
implemented a special system for the first time.

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:12.430
All right, please begin.

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:18.330
The first part of this system is the Exam Summoning Battle.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:20.620
Battles are waged between
Summoned Beings of different classes,

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:23.150
which are given form by the latest technology.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:27.580
The other key element of the system is classroom
facilities which directly correspond to one's ability.

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:29.970
Students take a placement exam at the end of each school year,

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:35.280
and are then divided into six classes
from A through F based on their scores.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:40.140
Finally time to take the placement exam...

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:43.430
This ain't gonna be a walk in the park, but I can handle it.

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:03.790
Himeji!

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:07.080
Are you okay? Pull yourself together!

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:10.840
Leaving the room during the exam will result in a zero. Am I clear?

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:12.550
But teach!

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:13.930
What is it, Yoshii?

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:16.040
She's sick!

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:18.690
Yoshii...

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:28.520
You're late, Yoshii.

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:29.650
Ironman...

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:32.580
My name is Mr. Nishimura, not Ironman.

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:34.030
Here you go. You're the last one.

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:36.770
These are the results of your placement exam.

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:40.270
You'll be assigned to whatever class is written in there.

00:01:40.270 --> 00:01:41.360
All right.

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:45.260
I guess I might as well tell you this now.

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:53.630
After everything you showed me last year, I had my suspicions that you were an idiot.

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:59.770
However, after I saw your score, I realized that I was mistaken.

00:01:59.770 --> 00:02:04.060
I have to apologize for doubting you, Yoshii. You're not an idiot.

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:10.080
You're one hell of an idiot!

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:24.790
Something that grows when its alone, What is it?

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:26.070
One more chance, One more chance!

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:27.450
Never, Never give up!

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:28.750
One more chance, One more chance!

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:30.050
Never give up!

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:43.180
Meeting with someone else is easy

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:45.950
I decided what to say before they even asked

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:48.560
My heart beats fast thinking if I passed or not

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:50.740
I can't panic in this fight for love

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:53.810
Study! Study! Study! Keeps me up all night

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:56.440
I've got a dreaming genius inside me

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:59.020
I'd be great if everyone's wishes came true

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:01.190
I won't care about other people's lives

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:04.150
Perfect-area complete!

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:06.780
I'll definitely be waiting for you!

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:13.180
I can hear your voice from the Perfect-area!

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:14.490
Ah! Ear! Ear!

00:03:14.490 --> 00:03:17.760
Why? Why can't stop when I pass you

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:20.370
if I'm your counselor

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:22.960
"Are we friends?" Yes, we're friends."

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:24.960
But, I failed the test with a 0

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:28.270
No! I'll take it again! and again!

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:30.410
I'm serious. One more chance, please

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:34.880
There's something better for is in the future

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:40.970
Better than my life right now.

