00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:32.970
This is my classroom!?

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:35.480
Reality is a harsh mistress at Fumizuki Academy.

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:38.500
If one wishes to have a more comfortable educational experience, he or she must make better grades.

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:41.230
That is the academy's central tenet.

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:44.400
God damn... So I guess this is a caste system, huh?

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:47.510
Yoshii, hurry up and sit down.

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:50.860
Fine. Where do I sit?

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:52.290
Wherever you like.

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:53.490
