00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:01.880
Just deal with it.

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:06.340
Excuse me, but there's wind blowing in from the crack in the window. It's quite chilly.

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:07.760
Just deal with it.

00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:14.010
Excuse me, my table broke.

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:14.990
Just deal with it.

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:15.850
What the hell!?

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:19.140
Just kidding.

00:05:19.140 --> 00:05:22.440
Yes, reality is truly cruel at Fumizuki Academy.

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:27.120
I'm Fukuhara, the teacher for this class.

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:29.700
I hope we'll have a-

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:35.140
I'm going to go get this fixed. You
can study whatever in the meantime.

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:37.580
Man, this place sucks.

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:40.920
We're supposed to spend the entire year here?

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:43.790
Hey, man, you shoulda scored better on the test if you were gonna bitch.

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:43.920
Yuuji! You're in this class too?

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:44.040
Sakamoto
Yuuji! You're in this class too?

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:46.280
Yuuji
Sakamoto
Yuuji! You're in this class too?

