N-Nearly there...

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:12.660
Kouta Tsychiya
N-Nearly there...

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:14.310
I haven't lived in Japan for a while,

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:16.330
so I couldn't read the questions, that's all.

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:18.540
Looks like it's pretty lively in here.

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:20.120
Hideyoshi?

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:20.410
Kinoshita

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:20.450
Hideyoshi
Kinoshita

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:22.130
I'm in this class too.

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:23.170
Hopefully this won't suck too much.

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:24.670
I can drink to that.

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:29.550
Anyway, yeah, this is the worst class in the entire school.

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:32.300
All of the guys in here look retarded.

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:34.510
That includes you.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:38.430
Thank goodness we have a cute girl like Hideyoshi!

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:38.970
I'm a guy.

00:06:38.970 --> 00:06:39.770
Male
I'm a guy.

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:40.350
I'm a girl.

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:41.100
Female
I'm a girl.

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:41.520
I'm a girl.

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:43.080
You guys don't get it.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:48.660
Girls are beings who are so gentle and
kind that they can mend a broken heart...

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:50.940
Shimada, on the other hand,
is rough, frightening, and flat...

00:06:50.940 --> 00:06:53.110
Jesus Christ, my spine!

00:06:53.110 --> 00:06:54.450
Ow...

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:57.530
Excuse me, I'm sorry I'm late.

00:06:59.040 --> 00:06:59.160
I was in the nurse's office.

00:06:59.160 --> 00:06:59.290
Himeji
I was in the nurse's office.

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:02.490
Mizuki
Himeji
I was in the nurse's office.

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:04.460
Himeji
Mizuki

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:05.880
Himeji...

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:14.510
Yoshii!

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:16.430
What's the matter?

00:07:18.690 --> 00:07:20.600
Doesn't that hurt?

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:25.060
You're gonna snap my spine into two!

00:07:25.060 --> 00:07:26.780
