00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:27.690
It's gonna break... You bitch...

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:39.210
Don't leave us, Voyeur!

00:07:39.210 --> 00:07:40.430
Li... Li...

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:42.750
