00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:49.440
Voyeur! I'll save you!

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:51.570
There's no seating chart, so sit wherever you want.

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:52.660
Save him! Somebody save him!

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.760
Okay, thank you.

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:58.440
Umm, is that seat free?

00:07:58.440 --> 00:07:59.600
Yeah.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:04.140
Oh, so you got placed into class F...

00:08:05.020 --> 00:08:07.710
Well, let's make the best of it-

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:10.480
You're still sick?

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:12.440
Yeah, a little...

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:14.360
This place is worn out as hell.

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:16.140
Like, the cushions might as well be rocks.

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:18.670
The floor's a veritable breeding ground for mold.

00:08:18.670 --> 00:08:20.900
This isn't somewhere a sick person should be!

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:36.670
What's up?

00:08:36.670 --> 00:08:38.400
I've been thinking about something.

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:40.820
Isn't school, like, a microcosm of society?

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:43.790
How dare they segregate us like this!?

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:47.840
And they'll treat us like dogs if we complain about it.

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:49.580
As such, we'll simply have to challenge them fair and square.

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:51.840
Once we come into power and gain the right to speak up, we'll tell the world about-

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:55.190
In other words, you want somewhere more amenable to Himeji, yeah?

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:57.270
Hey, come on! I was trying to make it sound all noble!

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:58.610
Why'd you have to ruin it?

00:08:58.610 --> 00:09:02.160
To be honest, I was thinking the same thing.

00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:03.620
Really?

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:08.540
I want to prove to the world that grades aren't everything.

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:11.330
I'm pretty confident, at least.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:14.650
Wanna try it, Akihisa?

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:16.170
Yeah, let's try out an Exam Summoning Battle!

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:18.720
<b>Exam Summoning Battle</b>

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:21.270
Listen up, guys.

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:23.400
I'd like to propose something as your class representative.

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:26.890
I want us to engage in an Exam Summoning Battle!

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:28.800
What!?

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:31.450
An Exam Summoning Battle? What the...

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:37.240
Fumizuki Academy has a system called the Exam Summoning Battle, also known as the ESB.

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:39.210
Under the supervision of a teacher,

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:43.890
students can summon a Being with attack power proportional to their grades in a given subject.

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:46.520
They can challenge other classes using these Beings.

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:51.790
If a lower level class defeats a higher level
one, they will swap facilities and classrooms.

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:54.710
Guys, are you happy with this crappy room?

00:09:54.710 --> 00:09:56.130
Hell no!

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:59.050
If we win an ESB,

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:02.050
we'll be able to get class A's fabulous room!

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:05.550
We're the lowest class.

00:10:05.550 --> 00:10:06.970
The bottom of this school.

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:11.020
We're nothing but a bunch of garbage!

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:15.230
And that means that we have nothing to lose.

00:10:15.820 --> 00:10:18.390
So why don't we give it a shot?

00:10:18.390 --> 00:10:20.760
And we have him!

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:27.490
Yoshii Akihisa is a legendary Punishment Inspector.

00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:29.680
PUNISHMENT INSPECTOR

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:31.090
Seriously!?

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:31.830
Wow! I've never seen one before!

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:34.920
Amazing! He's left me in despair!

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:36.920
Well, uh, not really...

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:39.880
Yes, Himeji?

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:42.540
Are Punishment Inspectors strong?

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:45.150
Yeah. Only very special people can be one.

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:49.650
It's a title given to mentally
disabled kids who get bad grades.

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:51.720
It translates to "Idiot".

00:10:51.720 --> 00:10:54.210
In other words, a worthless piece of crap.

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:56.950
Wow! That's amazing!

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:58.520
Just take me now!

00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:02.720
If we win an ESB, we can kiss this classroom goodbye.

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:05.110
What say we give it a try?

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:10.340
We need to start with the class directly above us - class E.

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:12.600
Akihisa, you're now class F's ambassador.

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:14.330
Go and declare war on class E.

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:15.970
Me?

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:20.380
Don't bad things happen to ambassadors from weaker countries when they declare war?

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:23.230
Nah, only in movies and novels.

00:11:23.230 --> 00:11:25.800
Come on, who on Earth would mess with an ambassador?

00:11:26.010 --> 00:11:27.090
But...

00:11:27.970 --> 00:11:31.930
Akihisa, you're the only one who can do this for us.

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:34.180
Pretend that I tricked you or something. Hop to it!

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:39.860
You tricked me!

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:41.030
Yeah, this is about what I thought would happen.

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:42.440
You predicted this!?

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:44.950
Duh. I'm the rep for a reason.

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:46.660
At least act like you're sorry!

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:49.870
We can no longer turn back, Akihisa.

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:50.620
Are you prepared?

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:53.500
Isn't this what you wanted?

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:57.650
Yeah. Don't worry, I'm ready.

00:11:58.410 --> 00:12:03.640
Oh? The sophomores have declared an ESB during the first semester?

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:05.000
Interesting.

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:06.090
They have my permission.

00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:07.470
Understood.

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:11.010
Put on a nice show for me.

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:18.570
Our supervisor is Mr. Hasegawa.

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:22.090
Seize him right before fifth period, while he's walking to class E.

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:25.250
Mr. Hasegawa, the math teacher?

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:27.240
Math is my thing.

00:12:27.240 --> 00:12:31.070
All right, Shimada will be our
mainline, since she's good at math.

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:32.910
Himeji, are you good at math?

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:35.020
I'm not bad.

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:37.440
Then team up with me.

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:38.990
No.

00:12:38.990 --> 00:12:40.120
Why?

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:44.380
Your attack points are equal to the
grade you received on your last test.

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:46.670
Our last test was...

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:48.460
The placement exam.

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:52.550
I had to leave during the exam, so I got a 0.

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:58.140
You can take a recovery exam once the ESB begins.

00:12:58.350 --> 00:13:01.440
If Himeji takes it, she'll be able to join us when she finishes.

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:02.500
Okay...

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.230
Good luck.

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:06.440
Thanks.

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:23.500
We've seized Mr. Hasegawa!

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:27.880
It's time for war, people! Let's go!

00:13:29.210 --> 00:13:31.970
For crying out loud... these guys are friggin' morons.

00:13:33.280 --> 00:13:34.980
Guys, it's time to sortie.

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:37.300
Go teach those failures a lesson!

00:13:45.770 --> 00:13:47.840
Minami Shimada, reporting in.

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:50.300
Hideyoshi Kinoshita, ready to go.

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.840
Kouta Tsychiya, same here!

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:54.530
Permitted.

00:13:56.200 --> 00:13:57.830
Summoning Being!

00:13:58.340 --> 00:14:08.650
Summon!

00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:31.340
Why was I the only one with a transformation sequence?

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:32.280
Here they come.

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:40.120
Be careful. Living flesh can't cross that barrier.

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:42.160
If you wanna get past here, you're gonna have to beat us first.

00:14:43.510 --> 00:14:45.520
Yoshiko Mika, I accept.

00:14:45.520 --> 00:14:46.470
Summon!

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:51.140
You brat...

00:14:52.110 --> 00:14:53.260
You're finished!

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:55.360
That's my line!

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:56.450
You're kidding...

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:59.140
There's no way class E can beat me at math!

00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:02.230
Those who were KIA, meet in the detention room.

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:03.120
That's...

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:03.850
Ironman!

00:15:04.140 --> 00:15:08.760
Acording to ESB rules, those whose points reach zero must receive supplementary lessons.

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:14.110
Save me! I don't want to have detention with this monster!

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:17.320
If you want to pass, then you have to defeat us.

00:15:17.320 --> 00:15:20.200
Very well, then.

00:15:20.830 --> 00:15:22.200
Summon!

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:24.480
Let's go!

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:28.850
Supply Room

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:33.800
Hurry up and get started.

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:38.090
What's our plan, Yuuji?

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:40.030
We don't have one.

00:15:40.030 --> 00:15:44.880
It's like tug-of-war - whichever class gets
pushed back will have their classroom invaded.

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:47.550
And if their rep gets defeated, that side loses.

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:49.920
That won't happen to us, right?

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:52.230
Dammit! They're pushing us back!

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:55.930
Class E has better grades overall.

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:58.770
If we go head to head, it's only a matter of time before we lose.

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:00.610
You're kidding me.

00:16:00.610 --> 00:16:06.670
Still, they are only class E. It'll take them a while to make it all the way here.

00:16:07.100 --> 00:16:08.960
And the time it'll take them to do that is the key to our victory.

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:12.670
My points...

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:16.270
They're gonna murder us at this rate!

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:18.890
Go on standby and recover your points.

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:19.390
All right.

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:28.020
I want to take the recovery test!

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:33.310
Whatever you recieve on this test will become your Being's attack points the next time you summon it.

00:16:33.310 --> 00:16:37.370
If you score low, then your Being will become weak.

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:38.450
Are you all right with that?

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:39.800
Yes.

00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:41.370
Which subject?

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:43.120
Math, please.

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:46.430
I need to answer as much as I can to recover my points...

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:49.220
Oh, no!

00:16:49.220 --> 00:16:50.580
Voyeur!

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:53.170
Retreat!

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:56.800
This is our victory.

00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:06.360
Shit!

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:09.230
Assault them.

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:12.320
Our defensive line is down.

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:14.200
This is bad, Yuuji!

00:17:18.980 --> 00:17:22.870
Numbers are just numbers... they're not Japanese.

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:26.960
Oh god, kanji!

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:29.150
I'll skip this question.

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:42.840
Those who were KIA, meet in the detention room!

00:17:43.680 --> 00:17:45.930
What should we do, Yuuji?

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:47.810
Are you guys finished?

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:51.100
Sorry, but it looks like it's about time for us to end this.

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:56.230
My, my, coming here yourself, eh? Don't underestimate us.

00:17:56.230 --> 00:17:59.860
Are you guys idiots? You declared an ESB as soon as school began.

00:17:59.860 --> 00:18:01.810
We just finished taking the placement exam.

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:03.770
Our differences in class are equivalent to our differences in points.

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:06.220
Did you really think you'd win?

00:18:06.220 --> 00:18:07.740
Beats me.

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:08.840
I see.

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:11.290
You guys are in class F because you're so stupid, I guess.

00:18:11.910 --> 00:18:16.130
Yuuji, we're not going to be able to beat the classes above us without a plan...

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:19.880
Oh yeah, I do have a plan.

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:23.680
Know why I kept you with me?

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:27.930
I see.

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:29.810
Don't tell me...

00:18:29.810 --> 00:18:33.520
Correct! He's Akihisa Yoshii, the Punishment Inspector.

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:36.900
Akihisa, show them your true power!

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:42.780
Guess I've got no choice... It always comes down to me in the end.

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:44.410
Summon.

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:50.630
The Punishment Inspector's Being has special powers.

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:53.890
Because it has to assist teachers with their chores as punishment,

00:18:53.890 --> 00:18:55.500
it's corporeal, unlike the rest.

00:18:56.480 --> 00:19:02.940
Also, any pain it feels will be felt by its summoner as well.

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:05.670
Isn't it cool?

00:19:05.670 --> 00:19:06.980
That's all?

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:07.470
Fine.

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:10.440
I'll take care of that small fry first.

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:11.390
Summon!

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:13.440
You won't take me down that easily!

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:14.190
Charge!

00:19:21.780 --> 00:19:24.980
Owowowowowow!

00:19:24.980 --> 00:19:28.120
It makes sense that you're the rep for E class.

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:30.370
Your bodyguard's pretty damn useless.

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:32.950
Nah, he's good enough.

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:40.090
I'll finish you off personally.

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:43.090
Get ready.

00:19:43.090 --> 00:19:46.720
I, Hiromi Nakabayashi, challenge you, Yuuji Sakamoto, to-

00:19:47.350 --> 00:19:48.770
Please wait!

00:19:49.780 --> 00:19:51.970
Mizuki Himeji, I accept!

00:19:51.970 --> 00:19:53.610
Summoning Being.

00:19:53.610 --> 00:19:54.480
Summon!

00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:55.990
Here I go!

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:03.160
Why are her points so high!?

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:05.010
This is class A level!

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:07.070
Why is a student like that...

00:20:07.070 --> 00:20:08.530
There she is.

00:20:08.530 --> 00:20:09.320
Himeji!

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:12.410
Mizuki Himeji... Don't tell me... you're...

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:13.660
Yoshii!

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:14.330
Shinada?

00:20:14.670 --> 00:20:16.830
She's totally awesome!

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:28.800
No wonder she was a candidate for class A...

00:20:28.800 --> 00:20:30.640
That's Himeji's score?

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:34.620
In Fumizuki Academy, you can take as many tests as you wish during the testing period.

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:36.700
As such, you can acquire as points as you are capable of.

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:38.720
So, your plan was...

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:40.380
to buy time while she took the test.

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:44.730
No one told me she was in class F!

00:20:44.730 --> 00:20:47.010
It's my turn. I'm sorry.

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:48.930
N-No way...

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:58.460
This Exam Summoning Battle ends in class F's victory.

00:20:58.460 --> 00:21:01.160
Wow, you're amazing, Himeji!

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:03.550
This is all thanks to you.

00:21:03.550 --> 00:21:06.090
Oh, you're just saying that...

00:21:06.090 --> 00:21:09.970
Now we can switch classrooms and facilities with class E!

00:21:09.970 --> 00:21:12.760
Well, it's better, at least...

00:21:12.760 --> 00:21:15.180
No, we're not switching facilities.

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:18.570
We'll keep what we have now.

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:20.980
Hey, don't you think it's a good idea, Nakabayashi?

00:21:20.980 --> 00:21:23.440
Wait, why?

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:26.230
Why, Yuuji? I mean, we won!

00:21:28.610 --> 00:21:30.530
So it's over?

00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:33.120
Hideyoshi, why are you dressed like that?

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:36.160
Ahh, that's it. You've finally understood the calling in your heart.

00:21:36.160 --> 00:21:39.100
I'm over here, Akihisa.

00:21:39.100 --> 00:21:40.740
There are two of you?

00:21:40.740 --> 00:21:42.410
That's my sister.

00:21:42.410 --> 00:21:44.880
Hideyoshi is my twin brother.

00:21:45.260 --> 00:21:49.410
I'm the ambassador from class 2A, Yuuko Kinoshita.

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:54.470
We, class A, declare war on you, class F.

00:21:55.890 --> 00:21:57.640
Why is class A declaring war on us!?

00:21:57.640 --> 00:22:00.500
Don't think we'll go easy on you just because you're the lowest class.

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:03.340
We're going to obliterate you.

00:22:10.480 --> 00:22:19.550
Baka, go go home!

00:22:19.840 --> 00:22:22.820
It's a time of peace now that school's out

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:24.370
If I were to compare her

00:22:24.370 --> 00:22:25.910
"She's a real angel!"

00:22:25.910 --> 00:22:28.880
Then a sudden note ruined my fun

00:22:28.880 --> 00:22:30.270
It said I have a makeup test!

00:22:30.270 --> 00:22:31.660
It's hell!

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:35.000
I was joking with my friends,

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:38.030
"There's no way someone is that stupid!"

00:22:38.030 --> 00:22:41.110
But deep down inside,

00:22:41.110 --> 00:22:42.400
I was screaming,

00:22:42.400 --> 00:22:45.360
"That was me! I'm that stupid!"

00:22:45.780 --> 00:22:51.940
I thought the "Monthly" sign in the parking lot

00:22:51.940 --> 00:22:57.220
was the company's name!

00:22:57.220 --> 00:22:59.970
For the longest time...

00:23:00.670 --> 00:23:03.670
Stupidity is a manly character

00:23:03.670 --> 00:23:06.370
Is that our lack of common sense?

00:23:06.370 --> 00:23:09.680
Rules are useless in this world

00:23:09.680 --> 00:23:12.680
Eat Korean BBQ every night and overthrow the masses!

00:23:12.680 --> 00:23:14.320
Look!

00:23:14.320 --> 00:23:18.890
The sun that rose from the west is now setting down.

00:23:18.890 --> 00:23:21.930
Run! It's almost dinner time.

00:23:21.930 --> 00:23:28.800
Let's go home!

00:23:36.780 --> 00:23:37.900
Question 2:

00:23:37.900 --> 00:23:40.080
Please answer the following question:

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:42.940
This plant has roots which can be eaten. In English, it is known as a "lily".

00:23:42.940 --> 00:23:44.330
Yam! Potato! Sweet potato!

00:23:44.330 --> 00:23:46.790
Please also pay attention to the second part of the question.

00:23:46.790 --> 00:23:48.830
Next episode: Lilies and Roses and PE.

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:50.500
This will be on your test.
